  "description": "SUGTIB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C120 H86 O26 Pr4 2-,2(C6 H16 N1 1+),3(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.796-4.063 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.64-113.65°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Pr4(O-DBM)4(HO-DBM)4(μ3-OH)2][Et3NH]2·3CH2Cl2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
